<title>USA: Simulation Sciences to acquire Salumunek.</title>
<headline>Simulation Sciences to acquire Salumunek.</headline>
<dateline>BREA, Calif. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simulation Sciences Inc on Tuesday said it has acquired almost all the assets of  Salumunek &amp; Associates Inc, a privately-held provider of plant performance software and services based in Houston, Texas.</p>
<p>The company's products are marketed to companies in the petroleum, petrochemical and industrial chemical industries.</p>
<p>Financial details were undisclosed.</p>
</text>
